message: >-
  If you use idenso, cite the version-specific Zenodo DOI for the version you
  used.
title: idenso
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Huber
    given-names: Lucien
    affiliation: University of Bern
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-5074-7313"
abstract: >-
  Idenso represents and manipulates tensor identities with Symbolica, including
  Dirac algebra, color algebra, and tensor simplification routines for
  high-energy physics.
keywords:
  - tensor identities
  - symbolic computation
  - high-energy physics
  - Symbolica
  - Rust
